IDENTIFICATION DIVISION.
PROGRAM-ID. PROG-PAGED-ATT-V4.

DATA DIVISION.
01 NUM-SOCKETS         PIC 9(9) USAGE R0.
01 PAGES-PER-SOCKET    PIC 9(9) USAGE R1.
01 SEQ-LEN             PIC 9(9) USAGE R2.
01 SAVINGS-PCT         PIC 9(9) USAGE R3.

PROCEDURE DIVISION.
MAIN-PAGED-ATT-V4.
    IF NUM-SOCKETS == 0 OR PAGES-PER-SOCKET == 0
        GO TO ERROR-EXIT.
    END-IF.

    MOVE 89 TO SAVINGS-PCT.

    SET depth 3.
    WEIGHT 32 NUM-SOCKETS.
    WEIGHT 30 SAVINGS-PCT.
    EVAL.
    PRUNE 15.
    GO TO END-STRATEGY.

ERROR-EXIT.
    SET depth 0.
    EVAL.

END-STRATEGY.
